.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=He%20said%20he%20and,by%20the%20rat%20Taigam.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Enlightened","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=He%20said%20he%20and,by%20the%20rat%20Taigam.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Enlightened\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragons-2015-02-25-e10","summary":"Master Taigam tells Sarkhan that Narset was a heretic punished to the full extent of the law and is no more.","participants":["sarkhan-vol","taigam","narset"],"location":"dragon-s-eye-sanctuary","importance":"major","page":"stories/tarkir-dragons-2015-02-25","order":60,"story_date":"2015-02-25","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":126,"quote":"Narset is no more.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragons-2015-02-25#:~:text=Narset%20is%20no%20more.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Tarkir of Dragons","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2015-02-25","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragons-2015-02-25","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragons-2015-02-25#:~:text=Narset%20is%20no%20more.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Tarkir of Dragons\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 25 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragons-2015-02-25-e11","summary":"Taigam throws Sarkhan down the stairs; Sarkhan flies off in despair, resolving to wake Ugin to repair the timeline.","participants":["sarkhan-vol","taigam","ugin"],"location":"dragon-s-eye-sanctuary","importance":"major","page":"stories/tarkir-dragons-2015-02-25","order":60,"story_date":"2015-02-25","storyline":"","sourc